    "detailed_description": "Game Features:<br />\r\n1.Strategic synthesis and upgrade methods that immerse you in mental calculations.<br />\r\n2.Combine three identical patterns to synthesize and collect resources.<br />\r\n3.Sandbox-style free play, creating unlimited possibilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay:<br />\r\n1.Synthesis rules: Combine three or more of the same type and level to construct advanced buildings.<br />\r\n2.Synthesizing more than three towers for upgrades yields stronger attack rewards.<br />\r\n3.Monsters invade at night; players should synthesize and eliminate them as much as possible, acquiring weapons and items to strengthen defenses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Items:<br />\r\n1.Treasure: Acquire a weapon.<br />\r\n2.Bomb: Deals direct damage to enemies.<br />\r\n3.Health Potion: Restores health points.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnemy Introduction:<br />\r\n1.Melee Monster: Balanced in health and speed.<br />\r\n2.Ranged Monster: Long attack distance but low health.<br />\r\n3.Mage Monster: Magic attacks with significant damage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBoss: Terrifying health. A nightmare for new players.",
